txtql::check::not_repeated

  × `FOR` needs a repeated value, but `x` is text
   ╭─[query:1:26]
 1 │ TEXT = x:WORD AS [ y FOR x ]
   ·                          ┬
   ·                          ╰── not a list
   ╰────
  help: lists come from captures inside a repetition of more than one item, e.g. `1 TO n` (`0 TO
        1` gives one value or null)
